1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:09,114
The angle of contact, theta, is the angle between the solid surface and the tangent to the liquid at the point of contact, measured through the liquid.

2
00:00:09,114 --> 00:00:12,486
For water on clean glass it is nearly zero.

3
00:00:12,486 --> 00:00:16,432
For mercury on glass it is about one hundred forty degrees.

